{
  "comment": "Canonical expiry and material-drift cases, shared by packages/banner/src/renewal.test.ts and every native shell's ConsentGate. See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-mobile-ios-shell-design.md section 4.4. The code is duplicated per platform; these cases are not. Changing semantics means changing this file, which fails every shell's suite until each is updated.",
  "now": "2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z",
  "expiry": [
    { "name": "within the window", "at": "2026-07-24T00:00:00.000Z", "validityDays": 180, "expired": false },
